{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生写真の撮影がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに会えたし幸せやったな^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近若月を直視できません...\n助けて←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月から話しかけてくれるんだけどね\nもうねーデレデレしすぎて\nしゃべれないーのおおおおお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、生駒の髪型好きすぎて\n今日も髪をなでなでしてました。\n生駒イケメンなのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんにぎゅーもしました。\n落ち着きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木充なのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後は5thの振り入れ♪\nけっこう久しぶりに\nからだ動かしたから疲れた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもめっちゃ楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスだいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京で遊ぶオススメスポットは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショッピングするなら原宿とかが\n良いと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかってゲームすんの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しないのよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飽きっぽいのよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近UFOキャッチャー\nとかよくするんだけど\n得意な方なのかな(￣▽￣)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲーセンなんて最近じゃ\n友達とプリクラ撮るためにしか\n行かないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔1、2回だけとったことあるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョジョ読んだことあるのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...読んでないから読むね。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れてる時どんなことしたら\n元気になれるかな?(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の曲聴いたら\n元気になるよ(´・ω・`)\nまりっかブログ読んだら\n元気になるよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るのがいちばんいいよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮るのすきなのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきだす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/20/8917230/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}